UPDATE companies SET description='Bluepeak is headquartered in Rapid City, South Dakota. The company operates fiber-to-the-home networks across six states: Oklahoma, Wyoming, South Dakota, North Dakota, Texas, and Minnesota. Leadership includes Chief Executive Officer Rich Fish, a telecom veteran with prior roles at AT&T and WOW!, Chief Operating Officer Cash Hagen, a U.S. Marine Corps veteran, Chief Commercial Officer Lana Frank, Chief Business Development Officer Mike Harry, Vice President of Human Resources Mary Armstrong, and General Counsel Marc Krasney. The founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

Bluepeak builds and operates a fiber-to-the-home network delivering symmetrical speeds up to 5 Gbps for residential customers and up to 10 Gbps for businesses. The company offers tiered internet plans starting at 300 Mbps, with included eero Secure Wi-Fi and modem on higher tiers, plus professional installation. It also provides television services through a traditional channel lineup (Bluepeak TV) and an app-based streaming platform (Bluepeak Stream). As of the latest figures, the network connects over 275,000 homes. A dedicated New Construction division handles ongoing fiber expansion.

The company serves both residential and business customers in its six-state footprint. Residential users include households streaming, gaming, and working remotely, while business customers range from small offices to enterprise accounts requiring high-bandwidth, low-latency connectivity. Bluepeak positions its service for applications such as telehealth, online learning, and remote work.

Bluepeak emphasizes community investment beyond infrastructure, citing a commitment to "connect people and create access and opportunity where there wasn''t any before." The company is Great Place to Work® Certified and highlights local, regional support call centers as a differentiator. Its stated mission is to deliver "unexpectedly fast internet, affordably priced, locally rooted."', certifications=ARRAY['Great Place to Work® Certified']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Fiber-to-the-home network deployment", "Residential symmetrical fiber internet (300 Mbps \u2013 5 Gbps)", "Business symmetrical fiber internet (up to 10 Gbps)", "Bluepeak TV traditional cable-style channel lineup", "Bluepeak Stream app-based streaming aggregation", "Professional fiber installation", "New construction fiber network expansion", "Local customer support operations"], "industries": ["Telecommunications", "Broadband internet service", "Residential connectivity", "Business connectivity", "Television entertainment", "Digital inclusion / community development"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Symmetrical fiber speeds up to 5 Gbps residential, 10 Gbps business", "No annual contracts or data caps on residential plans", "Regional support call center with local representatives", "Great Place to Work\u00ae Certified workplace culture", "Community investment programs including digital equity initiatives"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Rapid City, South Dakota -> db", "Operates in Oklahoma, Wyoming, South Dakota, North Dakota, Texas, Minnesota -> /about-us", "Leadership team: Rich Fish (CEO), Cash Hagen (COO), Lana Frank (CCO), Mike Harry (CBDO), Mary Armstrong (VP HR), Marc Krasney (General Counsel) -> /about-us", "Cash Hagen is a U.S. Marine Corps veteran -> /about-us", "Fiber network connects over 275,000 homes -> /", "Residential symmetrical speeds up to 5 Gbps, business up to 10 Gbps -> /about-us", "No annual contracts, no data caps -> /", "Great Place to Work\u00ae Certified -> /about-us", "Offers Bluepeak TV and Bluepeak Stream -> /about-us", "New Construction division for fiber expansion -> /", "Local regional support call center -> /", "Community investment focus -> /about-us", "LinkedIn URL -> db"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Bluepeak delivers fast, reliable fiber internet across Oklahoma, Wyoming, South Dakota, North Dakota, Texas, and Minnesota.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["https://www.linkedin.com/company/hellobluepeak/"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='bluepeak' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
