UPDATE companies SET description='Brian Hubel operates Hubel Handcrafted Interiors Inc. from Colorado Springs, Colorado. The business, founded by Brian A. Hubel, builds custom furniture one piece at a time and also offers woodworking classes and shop services to other woodworkers.

