UPDATE companies SET description='Bridgetown Natural Foods operates from its headquarters in Portland, Oregon, and a second facility in Mt. Juliet, Tennessee. The company was founded by Kelly Klock and Dan Klock after Kelly, while building a national granola brand, struggled to find a manufacturing partner that could meet her high standards for food quality. They established Bridgetown to provide better products and service to the natural foods community. Although the exact founding year is not disclosed, the company achieved B Corporation certification in 2014, indicating it was operational by that time.

Bridgetown designs and manufactures portable natural food snacks, offering product development, production support, and scalable supply chain solutions. Its output focuses on organic and plant-based foods, serving both entrepreneurial and established brands.

Its customer base includes innovative product creators and established companies in the natural foods sector that share a commitment to quality ingredients.

Bridgetown differentiates itself through a mission-driven approach summarized by the slogan "We Make the Food We Want Our Families to Eat." As one of the first manufacturers to certify as a B Corporation, it undergoes a rigorous social responsibility audit every three years, measuring performance against environmental, social, and community impact goals. The company emphasizes a culture of humble, conscientious problem-solvers and invests in employee growth, with examples of team members advancing from production roles to leadership positions.', certifications=ARRAY['B Corporation Certification']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Food snack manufacturing", "Product design and development", "Production support", "Scalable supply chain solutions", "Organic and plant-based food production"], "industries": ["Natural foods", "Gluten-free foods", "Organic foods", "Food and beverage manufacturing"], "materials": ["Organic ingredients", "Plant-based ingredients", "Gluten-free ingredients"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Certified B Corporation since 2014 with a 2025 score of 121.5", "Mission-driven manufacturing: ''We Make the Food We Want Our Families to Eat''", "Partnership-focused model for natural, gluten-free, and organic brands", "Employee-centric culture with internal promotion and community initiatives"], "facts_used": ["Founded by Kelly Klock and Dan Klock to provide better manufacturing for natural foods brands -> /about", "Headquartered in Portland, Oregon with a second facility in Mt. Juliet, Tennessee -> /about", "Certified B Corporation in 2014, recertified in 2025 with score 121.5 -> /about", "Designs and manufactures portable natural food snacks -> /", "Partners with natural, gluten-free, and organic brands -> /", "Expansion in Tennessee announced in 2026 adding 237 jobs -> /about", "Mission: ''We Make the Food We Want Our Families to Eat'' -> /about", "Employee testimonial about promotion from production 