UPDATE companies SET description='C & O Manufacturing was founded in 1995 by Cesar and Oscar in a cramped storage-like shop in Irwindale, California. The two founders worked 16-hour days cutting, rolling, bending, and welding steel, building a reputation through word-of-mouth without advertising. Now headquartered in Pico Rivera, California, the company operates as a family-owned business where the founding philosophy of hands-on craftsmanship continues to guide operations.

The company provides custom display fabrication, metal fabrication, laser cutting, and custom industrial parts from a facility exceeding 32,000 square feet. Its shop includes 14 welding stations staffed entirely by skilled craftsmen—no robots—and offers in-house capabilities spanning cutting, rolling, bending, welding, laser etching, powder coating, chrome plating, painting, assembly, and packaging. C & O also produces wood and acrylic displays, combining metal with wood, plastic, glass, and other materials to create countertop displays, floor displays, and trade-show componentry.

C & O serves industries including beauty, hospitality, retail, exhibit, casino, and hotel sectors, as well as industrial clients needing custom machine parts. Its portfolio includes display work for Las Vegas casinos and hotels such as Hilton, Cosmopolitan, Renaissance, and Marriott, along with projects for Disney and Tesla. The company also handles smaller runs, such as 25 to 50 countertop cosmetic testers.

The founders started with a vision of perfect craftsmanship and grew by teaching each new hire the same skills. The company emphasizes integrity, respect, community, teamwork, and safety as core values. Its differentiator lies in a one-stop-shop model that integrates design, engineering, prototyping, and finishing under one roof, all executed by experienced craftsmen rather than automated lines.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom display fabrication", "Metal fabrication", "Laser cutting", "Laser etching / surface marking", "Welding (14 stations)", "Cutting, rolling, bending", "Powder coating", "Chrome plating", "Painting", "Assembly", "Packaging", "Wood fabrication", "Acrylic fabrication", "Design and engineering", "Prototyping", "Custom industrial parts", "Trade show componentry", "Countertop displays", "Floor displays"], "industries": ["Beauty", "Hospitality", "Retail", "Exhibit", "Casino", "Hotel", "Industrial machinery"], "materials": ["Steel", "Wood", "Acrylic", "Plastic", "Glass"], "equipment": ["14 welding stations", "Laser cutting/etching system"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["No robots at any of 14 welding stations; all work by highly-skilled craftsmen", "Over 32,000 sq ft facility in Southern California", "One-stop-shop: metal, wood, acrylic, plastic, and glass combined in-house", "In-house design, engineering, prototyping, finishing (powder coating, chrome, paint), assembly, and packaging", "Grown through word-of-mouth; never advertised"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1995 in Irwindale, California by Cesar and Oscar -> /about", "Headquarters in Pico Rivera, California -> db", "Over 32,000 sq ft facility -> /about", "14 welding stations, no robots -> /about", "Family-owned, hands-on craftsmanship -> /about", "Core values: Integrity, Respect, Community, Teamwork, Safety -> /about", "Never advertised, grew through word-of-mouth -> /about", "Industries served: Beauty, Hospitality, Retail, Exhibit, Casino, Hotel -> / and /services", "Clients: Hilton, Cosmopolitan, Renaissance, Marriott, Disney, Tesla -> /about", "Processes: metal fabrication, laser cutting, welding, powder coating, chrome, paint, assembly, packaging, wood/acrylic fabrication -> / and /services", "One-stop-shop with in-house design, engineering, prototyping, finishing -> /services", "Laser etching capability -> /", "Custom industrial parts for machinery -> /", "Countertop displays, floor displays, trade show componentry -> / and /services"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We have no robots at any of our 14 welding stations. Real, highly-skilled craftsmen with real and extensive experience and wisdom forge raw steel into complex and finely detailed parts.", "founded_year": "1995", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='c-o-manufacturing-custom-metal-fabricator' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='C&K Woodworks operates from a warehouse in Oak Park, Michigan, where founders Chris and Kai have spent roughly five years building a business around live-edge lumber and custom woodworking.

The shop produces custom tables, bar tops, countertops, and shelving, while also selling raw live-edge slabs for DIY builds. All lumber is locally sourced, hand-selected, and kiln-dried to 6–8% moisture content to stabilize the wood for interior or exterior use. A board-planing service prepares slabs to uniform thickness before fabrication or pickup.

Customers range from homeowners furnishing a dining room to commercial clients outfitting offices and hospitality spaces. The warehouse doubles as a showroom where buyers can inspect slabs in person and consult on design details before production begins.

