UPDATE companies SET description='CKC Automation was founded in 2005 in Benicia, California, as a multidisciplinary engineering and manufacturing partner specializing in industrial automation. The company operates from a single integrated facility in the Bay Area, combining machine design, controls engineering, data systems, and UL 508A-certified control panel fabrication under one roof.

