UPDATE companies SET description='Cable Man, Inc. was founded in 1972 and operates as an outside plant (OSP) construction contractor headquartered in Baton Rouge, Louisiana, with a corporate office in Biloxi, Mississippi, and additional locations in Metairie and Baton Rouge, Louisiana, and a satellite office in Alabama. The company began as a utility and telecommunications contractor serving the Gulf Coast region.

