UPDATE companies SET description='California LightWorks was founded in 2008 in Canoga Park, California. The company designs and manufactures LED horticultural lighting fixtures domestically.

The company produces the MegaDrive® system—a centralized power LED platform that eliminates overhead wiring and in-canopy drivers. The lineup includes the Linear series for greenhouses (MDL 400, MDL 600), the Vertical series for multi-tier indoor grows (MDV 400, 600, 800), the UnderCanopy system for lower-canopy lighting, and 3 kW and 10 kW power units that support up to 80 fixtures. Additional product families are the programmable SolarSystem® and plug-and-play SolarXtreme® series. All fixtures are built in the USA with in-house design, engineering, and support.

California LightWorks serves commercial greenhouse operators, indoor vertical farms, cannabis cultivators, and home growers. The MegaDrive Linear is tailored for greenhouse applications with minimal shading, the Vertical series fits multi-level rack systems, and the UnderCanopy system targets lower-canopy production. The company also markets directly to home cultivators through its Pro-Grade line.

The company emphasizes its Made-in-USA manufacturing, complete in-house control over design and engineering, and a five-year warranty. Its centralized power architecture reduces installation costs, heat load, and canopy electronics, while two-channel spectrum control allows stage-specific tuning. Fixtures carry UL 8750, CSA, and CE certifications; power units meet ANSI/CAN/UL 8800:2019.', certifications=ARRAY['UL 8750','CAN/CSA-C22.2 No.250.13','ANSI/CAN/UL 8800:2019','CE']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["LED grow light manufacturing", "In-house product design and engineering", "Centralized power system design", "Two-channel spectrum control programming", "Passive thermal management (fixtures)", "Active thermal management (power units)", "Safety compliance testing (UL 8750, CSA, CE, ANSI/CAN/UL 8800)", "Bluetooth Mesh network integration", "Commercial cultivation lighting layout", "Greenhouse and indoor lighting system installation support"], "industries": ["Commercial horticulture", "Greenhouse cultivation", "Indoor farming", "Vertical farming", "Cannabis cultivation", "Home horticulture"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Centralized MegaDrive\u00ae power system eliminates in-canopy drivers and overhead wiring", "Two-channel spectrum control (0\u2013100%) for vegetative, flowering, and finishing phases", "Up to 80 fixtures per 10 kW power unit, 27 fixtures per power drop", "Designed, engineered, and manufactured in the USA with a 5-year warranty", "Fixtures certified to UL 8750, CAN/CSA-C22.2 No.250.13; power units to ANSI/CAN/UL 8800:2019 and CE"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2008 -> db", "Headquartered in Canoga Park, California -> db", "Manufactures LED horticultural/grow lighting fixtures domestically -> db", "MegaDrive\u00ae centralized power LED system -> /", "In-house design, engineering, and support -> /", "Product lines: MegaDrive Linear, Vertical, UnderCanopy, Power Unit, SolarSystem, SolarXtreme -> /", "Safety certifications: UL 8750, CAN/CSA-C22.2 No.250.13, ANSI/CAN/UL 8800:2019, CE -> /", "5-year warranty on fixtures -> /", "Serves commercial greenhouse, indoor, vertical farming, cannabis, home cultivators -> /", "Two-channel spectrum control -> /", "Bluetooth Mesh connectivity -> /", "Passive thermal management on fixtures, active on power units -> /", "Up to 80 fixtures per 10kW power unit -> /", "Made in USA -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "LED horticultural/grow lighting fixtures, manufactured domestically", "founded_year": "2008", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["https://www.linkedin.com/company/california-lightworks/"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='california-lightworks' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
