UPDATE companies SET description='Carina Inc operates from New York City''s Garment District at 242 West 38th Street. After opening a first facility with a partner in 1973, Sabetay branched out on his own to create Carina New York, and his daughter Paula Stvan joined the following year. The business remains family-owned and operated.

