UPDATE companies SET description='Caroba Plastics Inc is headquartered in Englewood, Colorado, in the Denver metropolitan area. The company was founded in 1983 by Barry Hart as a small, family-owned operation with two injection molding machines and a vision to provide high-quality plastic parts. Hart remains the owner and drives a hands-on philosophy emphasizing clean, organized facilities, systematic processes, and personal attention.

